WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
Sam holds up his maths homework
and asks: ¿Ves el problema?

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.730
"Do you see the problem?

3
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.410
" Lucía answers: Sí, lo veo.

4
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.010
"Yes, I see it.

5
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.870
" There's no word for "I" anywhere.

6
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.170
And the word for "it" has
jumped in front of the verb.

7
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:20.450
So where did "I" go, and what
decides where "it" sits?

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.730
In this mission, you'll meet the
subject pronouns and see when

9
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:24.840
you need them at all.

10
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.030
You'll learn the little words
for "it", "him" and "her",

11
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.750
and for "to him" and "to her".

12
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.010
Then you'll use reflexive
verbs for your daily routine:

13
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.030
Me levanto.

14
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.410
"I get up.

15
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.990
" Your mission: find the missing
"I" and work out where "it"

16
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.210
sits.
